{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg1GKnmfY96RVaRHGj12q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`/work/fateh_021.lean` now compiles with `lean /work/fateh_021.lean`. There are no errors and no `sorry` warning.\n\nI added helper definitions and lemmas before the theorem, which goes beyond replacing the single `sorry`. The imports, the docstring and the theorem statement are unchanged. I did not inline the helpers into the proof, since that would have been messy.\n\nThe proof, with G = ℤ/3 × ℤ/9:\n\n1. **Parametrise automorphisms.** An automorphism of G is determined by the images (a, b) of the generators (1,0) and (0,1). A pair (a, b) comes from an automorphism exactly when 3a = 0 and the map z ↦ z.1.val • a + z.2.val • b is a bijection. A helper `mk` builds the additive map from such a pair, using that 3a = 0 and 9b = 0 (the latter checked by `decide`).\n2. **Build the equivalence.** I showed `AddAut G` is equivalent to the subtype of pairs satisfying that condition, so their cardinalities agree.\n3. **Count the pairs.** The subtype has exactly 108 elements, proved with `decide +kernel`, not `native_decide`.\n\nI added no axioms."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":8512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":626,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":415,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8d516e0-df56-495b-93da-7832bfbadb65","uuid":"a57aa530-4fba-4eb3-b4d6-5f9e8e0be601","timestamp":"2026-10-14T01:30:55.384Z","request_id":"req_011Cg1GKnSovuLBHmaGxLd2y"}
